EmbersStorm - AirStrike Aviation Pack
Low Poly Stylized Military & Civilian Aircraft | Unity 6 Ready
Publisher: EmbersStorm AS Publisher | Version: 1.0 | 34 Prefabs

OVERVIEW
EmbersStorm - AirStrike Aviation Pack is a low poly stylized aircraft collection featuring 34 unique prefabs including military jets, fighters, cargo planes, propeller aircraft, and helicopters. Every model is atlas-ready, optimized for real-time use, and drops straight into your game with zero setup.

WHAT'S INCLUDED

34 unique aircraft prefabs
Military jets, fighter planes, cargo aircraft, propeller planes, helicopters
Single atlas texture per aircraft — minimal draw calls
Clean naming — easy to find everything in your project
Correct pivot points for flight physics integration
URP materials pre-assigned — no setup needed


TECHNICAL SPECS

Unity Version: Unity 6 (URP)
Texture: Atlas system, 512px–1K
Style: Low poly stylized
Platforms: PC, Mobile, Console


HOW TO USE

Import the package into your Unity 6 project
Drag any prefab from the Prefabs folder into your scene
Attach your flight controller script and go


